/repos/storybookjs/storybook/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/deployments","created_at":"2016-03-18T04:23:44Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T17:56:23Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T17:55:46Z","git_url":"git://github.com/storybookjs/storybook.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:storybookjs/storybook.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook","homepage":"https://storybook.js.org","size":1090866,"stargazers_count":88816,"watchers_count":88816,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":9808,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2246,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["angular","components","design-systems","documentation","html","javascript","react","react-native","stories","storybook","styleguide","svelte","testing","typescript","ui","vite","vue","web-components","webpack","workshop"],"visibility":"public","forks":9808,"open_issues":2246,"watchers":88816,"default_branch":"next","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"There are new versions of cross-env available from npm.\n\n## 5.0.0\n\n## 5.0.0 (2017-05-11)\n\n\n#### Bug Fixes\n\n* **bin:** add a bin entry for cross-env-shell ([9c4f3462](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/9c4f3462))\n\n\n#### Features\n\n* don't change colons on non-PATH/NODE_PATH on win32 (#107) ([38814238](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/38814238))\n* **bin:** two bins (shell, non-shell) (#104) ([d7b48d5c](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/d7b48d5c), closes [#99](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/issues/99))\n\n\n#### Breaking Changes\n\n* Scripts using quotes or escape sequences will see a difference in behavior.\nSwitching to the second bin should resolve any issue.\n\nCloses #99.\n\n ([d7b48d5c](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/d7b48d5c))\n\n## 4.0.0\n\n## 4.0.0 (2017-03-31)\n\n\n#### Bug Fixes\n\n* Resolve value of env variables before invoking cross-spawn (#95) ([e8a16146](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/e8a16146))\n* Remove Windows => UNIX variable conversion (#94) ([0a846e60](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/0a846e60))\n* **module:** Add export for commonjs (#88) ([22d1c801](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/22d1c801))\n\n\n#### Features\n\n* Convert list delimiters for PATH-style env variables (#93) ([ea0ac4bd](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/ea0ac4bd))\n* **args:** convert embedded and braced variables in command args (#86) ([1b172fef](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/1b172fef))\n* **spawn:** add support for quoted scripts ([ea800213](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/ea800213))\n\n\n#### Breaking Changes\n\n* This is unlikely to break anyone, but now if you assign a variable to a variable (like `FOO=$BAR` with the value `$BAR` being assigned to `hello`, the command will be converted to `FOO=hello` whereas before it was `FOO=$BAR`).\n ([e8a16146](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/e8a16146))\n* %windows_style% env variables will no longer be converted to $unix_style in UNIX machines. To fix it, use always the UNIX syntax, cross-env will change the format in Windows machines as needed\n ([0a846e60](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/0a846e60))\n* If an env variable has : or ; in its value, it will be converted to : on UNIX\nsystems or ; on Windows systems. To keep the old functionality, you will need to escape those\ncharacters with a backslash.\n\n#80\n\n* chore: Add myself (DanReyLop) to the contributors list\n\n* Simplified logic. Now only : (UNIX-style) are converted to ; (Windows-style), not the other way around\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: You now must escape `:` to use it in a value of you don't want it to be swapped with `;` on Windows\n ([ea0ac4bd](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/ea0ac4bd))\n* Changes the behavior when passed quoted scripts or special characters interpreted by the shell.\n ([ea800213](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/ea800213))\n* `echo $var2/$var1` would not be changed on windows, now it is. This is kind of a bug, but we're doing a major version bump to be safe.\n ([1b172fef](https://github.com/kentcdodds/cross-env/commit/1b172fef))","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/2172/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/2172/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":16208124083,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAzqfmc4IzBUszwAAAAPGFFiz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/iss